{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Tare 是一款專為家庭煮食者與專業廚師而設的廚房換算工具，主打按密度換算食材、食譜份量縮放與精準廚房計算，適合希望減少烹調失誤、提升成品穩定度的人士。現時原價 US $0.99，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-246.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>精準換算與食譜縮放</h2>\n<p>內置 310 種以上專業食材資料，並以 USDA 與 King Arthur Baking 的密度資料核對，可換算杯、湯匙、茶匙、克、安士與毫升等單位。食譜份量可按混合分數即時縮放，放大時會提示調整膨鬆劑、鹽與辛香料的敏感用量，並設 10 倍規則保護，另備烘焙百分比與焗爐調整工具。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-260-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-261-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-262-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-263-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-264-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-265-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Tare: Kitchen Companion</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tare-kitchen-companion/id6761080645?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T20:04:20.555368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:41:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:17:47.390314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:57:47.107131+00:00","content_hash":"a26cc3c453294d70090febc9aaa4b1d53c0a51ab7efcadb0e63a986462240404","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}